  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-39-65">都会、町、部落、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-65-79">何処にも</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-79-111">朝鮮の人たち満ち溢れ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-111-137">働き　　たたかい</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-137-162">生活を打ち立て</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-162-194">話す言葉　国語正しく</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-194-211">われら朝夕</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-211-242">親密濃く深まりつつ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-242-280">出征、入営を送る折々には</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-280-321">先んじて旗振り、万歳を叫ぶ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-321-343">朝鮮の人たち</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-343-360">朝鮮の人等</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-360-403">手に力こもり、唇は叫びつつ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-403-453">心の底に徹し得ぬものがあるならん</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-453-496">常にわれかく思い　心沈みし</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-496-501">今</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-501-532">朝鮮に徴兵制布かる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-532-552">こころ新たに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-552-573">あつき手を挙ぐ</seg></p>
    </body>
